techpack help=Scaffold and TechPack both replace the armor stand, and a resource pack replaces that file rather than merging with it, so applying both loses whichever sits lower in your list. Compatibility declares TechPack on the armor stand so your own copy keeps working alongside this pack. Full Pack carries TechPack's own files as well, so this one pack is both.
techpack missing=TechPack is not available in this build
lowgeo=Low Geometry
lowgeo help=Scaffold draws every block in full detail. Vibrant Visuals lights each of those shapes, so a large structure can be demanding to render. Low geometry redraws only the most detailed blocks as simpler shapes, keeping their textures and their positions, which is far cheaper on the graphics card.
